      "subject": "על־פי דרכו",
      "rationale": "Seheberu se re 'ka molomo wa tsela ya gagwe' — se hlophile go ya ka tsela ya mothwanenyana ka boyena"
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "go ya ka tsela ya gagwe",
      "rationale": "Bafoleodi ba hlohleletša: go ya ka tsela ya mothwanenyana ka boyena, kapa ka tsela ya kwetšong ya gagwe, kapa ka tsela ya bohlale bjalo ka ge bontši ba bušago Modimong"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invitation",
      "subject": "hlahlisa",
      "rationale": "Taelo ya go ruta mothwanenyana e bitša mmadi go dira se ka nofo"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Hlahlisa ⟨את⟩ mothwanenyana go ya ka tsela ya gagwe; le ge a ka kgolwa, o ka se fologe go yona.",
